; Template: Manual Revenue Entry
; Copy this template and fill in the values
;
; Instructions:
;   1. Replace DATE with YYYY-MM-DD
;   2. Replace DESCRIPTION with the revenue source
;   3. Replace REVENUE_ACCOUNT with the appropriate account
;   4. Replace AMOUNT with the dollar amount
;   5. Add Stripe fee line if applicable
;
; Revenue accounts:
;   Income:Subscriptions:Pro          (Pro tier: $14/mo)
;   Income:Subscriptions:Creator      (Creator tier: $29/mo)
;   Income:APIKeys                    (Developer API access)
;   Income:Other                      (Tips, sponsorships, etc.)
;
; Typical subscription with Stripe fees (2.9% + $0.30):
;
; DATE * "Stripe" "DESCRIPTION"
;   Assets:Current:Cash:Stripe  NET_AMOUNT USD
;   Expenses:PaymentProcessing:StripeFees  FEE_AMOUNT USD
;   REVENUE_ACCOUNT  -GROSS_AMOUNT USD

; Example — Pro subscription:
; 2026-02-15 * "Stripe" "Pro subscription — user@example.com"
;   Assets:Current:Cash:Stripe  13.29 USD
;   Expenses:PaymentProcessing:StripeFees  0.71 USD
;   Income:Subscriptions:Pro  -14.00 USD

; Example — Creator subscription:
; 2026-02-15 * "Stripe" "Creator subscription — creator@example.com"
;   Assets:Current:Cash:Stripe  27.86 USD
;   Expenses:PaymentProcessing:StripeFees  1.14 USD
;   Income:Subscriptions:Creator  -29.00 USD
